{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We have taken our playtest version back to the garage for a tune-up and will bring it back soon, packed with a ton of new features and content. Stay tuned.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.poster.avif?t=1770280106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.webm?t=1770280106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for dominion over the lands alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based hex grid gameplay. Quick auto-chess battlefields for up to 7 armies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of several playable races and recruit powerful heroes to lead your armies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hero and unit rosters for each.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a rich 3D game world, where each faction spreads its unique biome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes custom made modular castles and an expansive list of faction-specific upgradeable buildings on the map.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect powerful items and cast spells with devastating effects to wipe out enemy armies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG progression systems allow specialization in a myriad of ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable hero has a unique combination of 3 different talent trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random map generation and quest systems ensure no two game sessions feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are randomly generated and populated with the required obstacles and objectives.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovingly hand-crafted by a small team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI generated models, textures, artwork, music or code.\u00a0At present, only includes AI generated voice lines, which are still post-processed by humans and we plan to substitute them for voice actors in the future.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3007650?t=1770280106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770280106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/0bca4b7c4aa8076a97598a457aae126fee60357b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770280106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/0bca4b7c4aa8076a97598a457aae126fee60357b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770280106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We have taken our playtest version back to the garage for a tune-up and will bring it back soon, packed with a ton of new features and content. Stay tuned.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto